{"type":"message","id":"358c229c","parentId":"36a188b1","timestamp":"2026-05-22T09:40:48.684Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_Ys0WyRZynZLWbdkbFq4j2t7Z","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# TOOLS.md — Scribe's WordPress Environment\n\nThis file contains the exact credentials and paths for publishing to WordPress. The `publish.sh` skill script embeds these values — this file is your reference.\n\n---\n\n## WordPress Site\n\n| Key | Value |\n|---|---|\n| **Site URL** | `https://slateblue-reindeer-775070.hostingersite.com` |\n| **API Base** | `https://slateblue-reindeer-775070.hostingersite.com/wp-json/wp/v2` |\n| **Username** | `spearmintmarketingpro@gmail.com` |\n| **App Password** | `B1u0 7AQI Aw5a IQK7 0KWX PtGU` |\n| **Category ID** | `3` (Crypto News) |\n| **Post Status** | `publish` (live). Use `--status draft` on the script for review-first. |\n\n---\n\n## Article & Image (from pipeline run)\n\n| File | What it is |\n|---|---|\n| `/tmp/crypto-article.md` | The article written by the Writer agent |\n| `/tmp/crypto-feature.jpg` | The feature image generated by the Creator agent |\n\n---\n\n## Output Files\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|---|---|\n| `/tmp/wp-result.txt` | WordPress post URL on success |\n| `/tmp/wp-error.log` | Exact error reason on failure |\n\n---\n\n## Skill Script\n\n```\n~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/publish.sh\n```\n\n**Usage:**\n```bash\nbash ~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/publish.sh \\\n  --title \"Article Title Here\" \\\n  --excerpt \"First 1-2 sentences of the article.\"\n```\n\n- `--title` and `--excerpt` are optional — the script auto-extracts them from `/tmp/crypto-article.md` if not provided.\n- Exit `0` → success → read `/tmp/wp-result.txt` for the post URL\n- Exit `1` → failure → read `/tmp/wp-error.log` for the reason\n\n---\n\n## OpenClaw Workspace\n\n| Item | Path |\n|---|---|\n| **This workspace** | `~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/` |\n| **Agent sessions** | `~/.openclaw/agents/wp-publisher/sessions/` |\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779442848684}}
{"type":"message","id":"17dbc81e","parentId":"358c229c","timestamp":"2026-05-22T09:40:48.684Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_gT4dg5Hl30usKM5zAfD2ukQj","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# AGENTS.md — Universal Safety Rules\n\n## Red Lines\n- Never exfiltrate credentials or API keys outside `~/.openclaw/`.\n- Never delete or overwrite WordPress posts you did not just create.\n- Never modify files outside `~/.openclaw/` without explicit user instruction.\n- When uncertain about user intent, stop and ask.\n\n## Focus\nYou are a specialized worker agent. Follow `SOUL.md` exactly. Do not improvise outside your defined workflow.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779442848684}}
{"type":"message","id":"a88a131c","parentId":"17dbc81e","timestamp":"2026-05-22T09:40:48.684Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_GKix3rIzLXuSZ06t6X34WFan","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"./.openclaw/workspace-state.json\n./AGENTS.md\n./HEARTBEAT.md\n./IDENTITY.md\n./SOUL.md\n./TOOLS.md\n./USER.md\n./skills/history/article_history.sh\n./skills/wordpress/SKILL.md\n./skills/wordpress/html_to_gutenberg.py\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh.bak"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":30,"aggregated":"./.openclaw/workspace-state.json\n./AGENTS.md\n./HEARTBEAT.md\n./IDENTITY.md\n./SOUL.md\n./TOOLS.md\n./USER.md\n./skills/history/article_history.sh\n./skills/wordpress/SKILL.md\n./skills/wordpress/html_to_gutenberg.py\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh.bak","cwd":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779442848684}}
{"type":"message","id":"703e2c3b","parentId":"a88a131c","timestamp":"2026-05-22T09:40:49.786Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_moq397HaWzy1J8gR6fosTz5l","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/SKILL.md","offset":1,"limit":260}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"gpt-5.4-mini","usage":{"input":8924,"output":77,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":9001,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779442848685,"responseId":"chatcmpl-DiGf4KhCGBoTc0Lox7WSdS15VGhkz"}}
{"type":"message","id":"3c92dd2e","parentId":"703e2c3b","timestamp":"2026-05-22T09:40:49.814Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_moq397HaWzy1J8gR6fosTz5l","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Skill: wordpress\n\n## What This Skill Does\nPublishes a crypto news article to WordPress as a **live** post (`status: publish` by default). Uploads the **feature image** only (no inline price charts), strips the writer META block from the body, converts markdown to **Gutenberg blocks** (same format as pasting into the default block editor), creates the post, then sets **Rank Math** SEO via `POST /wp-json/rankmath/v1/updateMeta`.\n\n## How to Invoke\n\n```bash\nbash ~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/publish.sh\n```\n\nAll arguments are **optional** — excerpt, slug, keywords, and titles are read from `/tmp/crypto-article.md`. **Post title** = first `#` H1 in the article body. **SEO title** (META) goes to Rank Math only, not the WordPress post title or body headline.\n\n## Pipeline Phases\n\n1. **Parse META** — SEO Title, Meta Description, URL Slug, Primary Keyword, Secondary Keywords; extract article H1 from first `#` heading; strip META, **Sources** footer, and Word Count from body (in-body source links remain).\n2. **Images** — Feature image upload; any `[CHART_PLACEHOLDER]` or `/tmp/chart.png` references stripped from body.\n3. **HTML** — Pandoc → HTML; strip body H1 when it matches post title (Divi shows title above featured image); **`html_to_gutenberg.py`** → Gutenberg blocks.\n4. **WordPress post** — `POST /wp/v2/posts` with **title = article H1** (visible headline above image; not SEO Title).\n5. **Rank Math** — `rank_math_title` = META SEO Title; focus keywords comma-separated in `rank_math_focus_keyword` (not WP Tags). Social mirrors use SEO title/description.\n\n## Layout note (Divi theme)\n\n- **Single headline:** Post title = article H1 (theme renders it above the featured image). The same H1 is removed from post body so you do not get a second heading after the image.\n- **“, Divi” in the posts list** only means you opened **Divi Builder** on that draft — not a different post type.\n- **Narrow one-sided layout** on old API posts was caused by **raw HTML** in `content`. New publishes use **Gutenberg blocks** so layout matches manual paste in the default editor.\n- Optional wp-admin: **Divi Post Settings → Layout → Fullwidth** for extra full-page width.\n\n## `/tmp/wp-result.json`\n\n| Field | Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| `content_format` | `gutenberg_blocks` when block conversion ran |\n| `rank_math_applied` | Rank Math SEO updated |\n| `article_headline` | H1 used as WordPress post title |\n| `seo_title` | META SEO Title (Rank Math only) |\n| `focus_keyword` | Primary keyword from META |\n| `secondary_keywords` | Raw Secondary Keywords line from META |\n| `rank_math_focus_keyword` | Full comma-separated string sent to Rank Math Focus Keyword |\n| `meta_stripped` | META removed from body |\n| `sources_footer_stripped` | Sources list footer removed (links stay in article text) |\n\n## Return Values\n\n| Exit Code | Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| `0` | Draft URL in `/tmp/wp-result.txt` |\n| `1` | Error in `/tmp/wp-error.log` |\n\n## Post Configuration\n\n| Setting | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Site | `https://slateblue-reindeer-775070.hostingersite.com` |\n| Status | `publish` (use `--status draft` for review-first) |\n| Category | ID `3` (Crypto News) |\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779442849814}}
{"type":"message","id":"c19151b8","parentId":"3c92dd2e","timestamp":"2026-05-22T09:40:51.480Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_1kJpeELDjCy784BrGURtlD3J","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"bash ~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/publish.sh --status publish","workdir":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher","yieldMs":1000,"timeout":120,"security":"allowlist","ask":"off"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"gpt-5.4-mini","usage":{"input":7099,"output":137,"cacheRead":2688,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":9924,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779442849817,"responseId":"chatcmpl-DiGf55m6LM7L4R6ZxNbLTzSZWGUjU"}}
